img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span></p></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"loot\"><p style=\"text-align: center; color: orange\"><b>Very Good</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0.4em 0 0.5em;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><br/><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">10.50<br/>July 7, 2014<br/>Summer Update 2014</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>In order to reach this dungeon, you must go through a <a href=\"#/wiki/Slime%20Slide\">Slime Slide</a> in <a href=\"#/wiki/Rathleton%20Magistrate\">Rathleton Magistrate</a> <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33669,31887,5\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33669, 31887, 5)</a>. To be able to enter, you must have cast at least 50 votes in the <a href=\"#/quest/rathleton-quest\">Rathleton Quest</a>. <a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin\">Paladins</a> can hunt here alone, but <a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">Knights</a> and Mages are recommended to hunt in teams. This dungeon is also erroneously called Catacombs.\n</p><p>This cave has three different set-ups. The current set-up in your world depends on which one gets the most votes in the <a href=\"#/quest/rathleton-quest\">Rathleton Quest</a>. The dungeon can be filled with either:\n</p>\n<dl><dd>A) <a href=\"#/wiki/Glooth%20Golem\">Glooth Golems</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Rustheap%20Golem\">Rustheap Golems</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Worker%20Golem\">Worker Golems</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/War%20Golem\">War Golems</a>,</dd>\n<dd>B) <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaurs\">Oramond Minotaurs</a>,</dd>\n<dd>C) <a href=\"#/wiki/Destroyer\">Destroyers</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Hellspawn\">Hellspawns</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Grim%20Reaper\">Grim Reapers</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Dark%20Torturer\">Dark Torturers</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Demon\">Demons</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Hellhound\">Hellhounds</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Juggernaut\">Juggernauts</a>.</dd></dl>\n<p>Every 14 days, the votes will be reset and the option which was the most popular at that time will take over. You decide.\n</p><p>All three possible set-ups are listed below.\n</p><p>Be cautious when hunting here however, as the <a href=\"#/wiki/Respawn\">respawn</a> in the dungeon is <b>random</b>, which means that not always the same monsters appear in the same place. After clearing a room, you will meet another creatures from current set-up when they spawn the next time you enter that room. For example a place that had only 5 Destroyers inside, next time may have 2 Hellhounds, 2 Juggernauts and a Demon!\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Possible_creature_configurations\">Possible creature configurations</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Set-up_A\">Set-up A</span></h3>\n<p>This will be good for <a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">Knights</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Sorcerer\">Sorcerers</a>, but not as good for <a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin\">Paladins</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Druid\">Druids</a>. Knights should gather a few monsters at once and use <a href=\"#/wiki/Berserk\">Berserk</a> and similar attacks. Sorcerers should use <a href=\"#/wiki/Thunderstorm%20Rune\">Thunderstorm Runes</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Wave\">Energy Wave</a>, and <a href=\"#/wiki/Rage%20of%20the%20Skies\">Rage of the Skies</a>. You may want a blocker.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Glooth%20Golem\"><img alt=\"Glooth Golem\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Glooth_Golem_349285.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Glooth%20Golem\">Glooth Golem</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">1,930</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">2,700</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">1176+ (<span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">931+ <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>, <sp