style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-264× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ultimate%20Health%20Potion\">Ultimate Health Potion</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Plate Shield (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Mana%20Potion\">Great Mana Potion</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>War Crystal (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Morning%20Star\">Morning Star</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Epee (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-5× <a href=\"#/wiki/Nail\">Nail</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Battle Shield (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Two%20Handed%20Sword\">Two Handed Sword</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Rusted%20Armor\">Rusted Armor</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Iron%20Ore\">Iron Ore</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarven%20Ring\">Dwarven Ring</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Crystal Pedestal (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Life%20Crystal\">Life Crystal</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Berserk%20Potion\">Berserk Potion</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Club%20Ring\">Club Ring</a> (rare)</li>\n<li>Bonebreaker (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Steel%20Boots\">Steel Boots</a> (rare)</li>\n<li>Crystal of Power (very rare)</li>\n<li>Jade Hammer (very rare)</li>\n<li>Berserker (very rare)</li>\n<li>Lightning Boots (very rare)</li>\n<li>Tin Key (very rare)</li>\n<li>Crystal Pedestal (Red)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Set-up_B\">Set-up B</span></h3>\n<p>This is good for Paladins and Mages but not as good for <a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">Knights</a>. Paladins should simply keep their distance and attack with <a href=\"#/wiki/Arrow\">Arrows</a> or <a href=\"#/wiki/Bolt\">Bolts</a>, whereas Mages can try to gather a few and use <a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Fireball%20Rune\">Avalanche Runes</a> to kill quickly.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable